import{_ as t,o as i,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 327 | Perfect-Work Energy-Waste Analysis: Shi Hao's Predatory Thinking — The Resource Cost of Taking Oneself as Seed","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 327 | Perfect-Work Energy-Waste Analysis: Shi Hao's Predatory Thinking — The Resource Cost of Taking Oneself as Seed","no":327,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Perfect World","Shi Hao","Predatory Thinking","Self-Seed","Stock Devouring"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","18-Cultivation Resource Opening Mechanism","15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0327_模块2-完美世界-以身为种的资源消耗.md","filePath":"en/0327_模块2-完美世界-以身为种的资源消耗.md"}`),s={name:"en/0327_模块2-完美世界-以身为种的资源消耗.md"};function r(a,e,l,u,h,c){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-327-perfect-work-energy-waste-analysis-shi-hao-s-predatory-thinking-—-the-resource-cost-of-taking-oneself-as-seed" tabindex="-1">Entry 327 | Perfect-Work Energy-Waste Analysis: Shi Hao&#39;s Predatory Thinking — The Resource Cost of Taking Oneself as Seed <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-327-perfect-work-energy-waste-analysis-shi-hao-s-predatory-thinking-—-the-resource-cost-of-taking-oneself-as-seed" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 327 | Perfect-Work Energy-Waste Analysis: Shi Hao&#39;s Predatory Thinking — The Resource Cost of Taking Oneself as Seed&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Perfect-Work Full Decomposition (Entry 4) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 18, 15</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-cleanest-cultivation-hides-the-most-thorough-stock-devouring" tabindex="-1">Introduction: The cleanest cultivation hides the most thorough stock devouring <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-cleanest-cultivation-hides-the-most-thorough-stock-devouring" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: The cleanest cultivation hides the most thorough stock devouring&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;Taking oneself as seed&quot; is Perfect World&#39;s most fascinating setting — no external seeking, self-opening cave-heaven, one&#39;s own body as the seed of the cosmos. It sounds fully anti-predatory, actually takes predation to the extreme: not grabbing readymade, but converting one realm&#39;s nutrients into one&#39;s own &quot;seed.&quot; This entry takes the six top-level axioms as base — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, law-first axiom (core), universal equal infinite law — to dissect self-seed&#39;s resource-consumption logic. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Protagonist uniqueness dependency verdict: <strong>Shi Hao = extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong>.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Self-seed&#39;s waste:</p><ul><li>It condenses a cave-heaven law that could have been &quot;co-farmed by Myriad Ranks&quot; into &quot;one person&#39;s exclusive inner cosmos&quot;</li><li>The bigger the seed, the more realm nutrients it draws; the fewer external resources distributable</li><li>Ultimately strong one and environment form a &quot;this消彼长&quot; zero-sum, not &quot;symbiotic mutual growth&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When the strongest one&#39;s growth comes at the cost of realm stock:</p><ol><li>Realm ecosystem overdrawn by strong one&#39;s growth</li><li>Other beings&#39; distributable resources decrease, general stagnation</li><li>Era ends, strong one exits, leaving an hollowed-out realm</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-this-entry-s-core" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (This Entry&#39;s Core) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-this-entry-s-core" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (This Entry&#39;s Core)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou judges predation not by malice but by structure. Self-seed&#39;s predation manifests in three layers:</p><ul><li><strong>Hidden stock devouring</strong>: on the surface &quot;no external seeking,&quot; actually cave-heaven opening, divine-material absorption, era-fortune convergence, all are transferring public stock into the individual body</li><li><strong>Growth zero-sum</strong>: every tier Shi Hao advances, same-realm competitors&#39; relative situation worsens by a notch. Supreme Bone, innate supreme treasures&#39; contention is explicit zero-sum; self-seed is implicit zero-sum</li><li><strong>No feedback</strong>: after the inner cosmos matures, its output does not feed back to the realm, but follows the person in single-handedly deciding eternity</li></ul><p>Key distinction: Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;self-origin self-growth evolution law&quot; develops <strong>increment</strong> Origin — the stronger the strong ones, the larger Myriad Ranks&#39; Origin pool; while self-seed develops <strong>stock</strong> — the bigger the strong one&#39;s seed, the poorer the realm. This is precisely the dividing line between the anti-predation axiom and predatory cultivation.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Self-Seed (Stock Devouring)</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis (Increment Development)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Inner cosmos within one person</td><td>Myriad Ranks co-farm the Origin pool</td></tr><tr><td>Growth consumes the realm</td><td>Growth feeds back to the realm</td></tr><tr><td>Opportunity zero-sum exclusion</td><td>300 systems fully open</td></tr><tr><td>Nutrients private</td><td>Joint contracting, more work more gain</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Replicate self-seed&#39;s stock-flow model</li><li>Compare under same conditions the &quot;increment development&quot; model</li><li>Count realm ecosystem health and Myriad-Rank evolution rate</li><li>Output &quot;Self-Seed Resource-Consumption Report&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium</strong>. Self-seed is self-consistent within the &quot;individual inner cosmos&quot; concept, but its relation to Myriad-Rank resource conservation is never strictly quantified</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium-high</strong>. The &quot;seed&quot; boundary expands with combat-power inflation</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong></li></ul><p>Add one layer: self-seed&#39;s zero-sum nature can be tested with realm-nutrient conservation. If the maturation of Shi Hao&#39;s inner cosmos is accompanied by continuous net outflow of external cave-heavens, divine materials, era fortune, then the stronger he is, the poorer the realm; this on the ledger is negative-sum. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s self-origin self-growth law requires strong one and realm to be positive-sum — the stronger the strong one, the larger the Origin pool. The dividing line between the two cultivation views ultimately is: does my growth need to cut a piece off you?</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: seed grows, realm impoverishes; energy conversion efficiency is negative</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: self-seed is hidden stock devouring, no feedback to Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s predation still stays at &quot;resource concentration&quot;; self-seed writes predation into the body of cultivation</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: one person&#39;s seed drains nutrients; Myriad Ranks&#39; evolution space is squeezed</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: stock logic cannot support multiverse&#39;s incremental expansion</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-resource-consumption-contrast" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Resource-Consumption Contrast <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-resource-consumption-contrast" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Resource-Consumption Contrast&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Self-seed&#39;s resource-consumption pattern, under Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alaya Network audit, presents as extremely high single-person resource occupancy. If the resources Shi Hao alone consumes are dispersed across the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s 300 systems, they could support several thousand cultivators&#39; simultaneous promotion. The law-first axiom opposes this centralized consumption, because the law network&#39;s optimal solution is distributed resource scheduling. The universal equal infinite law negates at the Origin level the reasonableness of &quot;one person devours Myriad Ranks&quot; — since everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, no one needs to &quot;seed&quot; for everyone.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Self-seed is web literature&#39;s most romantic cultivation symbol, but on Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s energy ledger, it is a bad account of &quot;personal surplus, realm deficit.&quot; True symbiotic evolution should be the stronger the strong one, the richer Myriad Ranks, not the stronger the lonelier.</p><p>In the final analysis, Perfect World · self-seed&#39;s resource consumption described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./328_模块2-完美世界-至尊骨被挖事件.html">Entry 328 · Supreme-Bone Dig-Out Incident</a> · <a href="./340_模块2-完美世界-个人进化与集体进化的对立.html">Entry 340 · Self-Seed Critique</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const g=t(s,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
